Z||000006||Master_Sushi||10-11-2001||09:56 AM||||First mod... Get rid of stock wheels! They are fugly, and way to small! Fieros love high quality, low profile tires also.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> This is the first big thing I did to my old coupe.<P>Second mod... Make sure you have a sunroof! If you dont have one add a stock one. Aftermarket ones pretty much suck. Fieros are the best with an open roof! I added a stock sunroof to mine. Its not "that" hard to do, mostly just painfully slow to get done right. OH ya ttops are good also  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sus88coup.jpg">  <P>Ah my old coupe   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I miss her...<p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 10-11-2001).]||||reg||14
